          "title": "Overview",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "1a.1",
              "text": "Aldan House on Cobbett Row in Nerridge collapsed, destroying the building and its east wing. Provincial Urban Search and Rescue (PUSAR) and Nerridge fire service have deployed to the site, rescuing 9 people and documenting injuries. Assistance was requested in Imber Street and Cobbett Row, with warnings issued for the area and ongoing information updates provided by Nerridge Emergency Management.",
